+- `v2/skeleton/components/assignment/component.css` ΓÇö verbatim from brief (tokens only, `@media print{.lna{display:none!important}}` included, minmax(0,Nfr) grids).
+- `v2/skeleton/components/assignment/component.js` ΓÇö verbatim from brief, plus the resolutions:
+  - top: `var LNpub = "__PUBKEY__", LNkeyId = "__KEYID__";` immediately followed by `window.LN.pub = window.LN.pub || LNpub; window.LN.keyId = window.LN.keyId || LNkeyId;`
